<title>USA: Ecolab acquires Canadian cleaning business.</title>
<headline>Ecolab acquires Canadian cleaning business.</headline>
<dateline>ST. PAUL, Minn. 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ecolab Inc said Tuesday it purchased the institutional, food and beverage and commercial laundry cleaning and sanitizing businesses of the Savolite Group, which is based in Vancouver, B.C.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Sales for the acquired businesses were about C$11 million (US$8 million) in 1996.</p>
<p>The acquired businesses complement Ecolab's products, equipment and systems for the institutional, laundry and food and beverage processing markets in Canada and the U.S. Pacific Northwest.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
